stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BootstrapRequired
    BootstrapRequired --> Authenticated: valid one-time token
    BootstrapRequired --> BootstrapRequired: invalid token or weak password
    Authenticated --> Authenticated: session valid and actor enabled
    Authenticated --> SignedOut: logout or session expiry
    Authenticated --> JobQueued: permitted refresh request
    JobQueued --> JobCompleted: worker rechecks actor and tenant
    JobQueued --> JobFailed: actor disabled, downgraded, or tenant mismatch
    SignedOut --> PasswordVerified: valid password
    PasswordVerified --> Authenticated: MFA not enabled in local prototype
    PasswordVerified --> MfaChallenge: MFA enabled; issue one-time challenge
    MfaChallenge --> Authenticated: valid, unused TOTP step
    MfaChallenge --> Authenticated: valid recovery code; revoke prior sessions and write blocked notification
    MfaChallenge --> SignedOut: invalid, expired, or replayed code
